      },
      {
        "text": "Sparse solo piano, slow and unhurried, with long silences, like light on still water",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Nordic folk melody on a single wooden flute, distant and breathy, over a soft drone",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Gentle nylon-string guitar picking, quiet and intimate, a summer evening by the sea",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Warm ambient pads with slow swells, deep blue and calm, barely moving",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Celesta and music box notes, childlike and a little sad",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Kantele plucked softly, Finnish archipelago, open fifths, airy",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Solo accordion, slow waltz, faded and wistful, far away across the water",
